# The top of the steps, in the gap in the fence (object 20).
# A waypoint of Zoe's walk-off at the end (zoe_ending.script, game flag
# 244): bodiless (model -1, nothing to bump into) and not falling (flags 0;
# zoe_yard.txt). Once she's within 600, she heads for the next one (object
# 21). The steps are the courtyard's only way out, so she goes by its
# middle (in sight of every corner), the foot of the steps, their top.

== life
  IF FLAG_GAME(244) == 1 else @wait
  IF DISTANCE(0) < 600 else @wait
  SET_DIR_OBJ 0 2 21
  SET_COMPORTEMENT @done
wait:
  END_COMPORTEMENT
done:
  END_COMPORTEMENT
  END
